WEBVTT

00:00:09,040 --> 00:00:18,700
Is it bad to pause the rife or if I can't finish a ball one night?

00:00:18,700 --> 00:00:24,700
Oh, so if you're saying, you know, the night program is nine hours long

00:00:24,700 --> 00:00:28,700
and you've got had to get up in seven and a half hours, should you pause it?

00:00:28,700 --> 00:00:34,700
No, don't pause it. Just let it run out or just turn it off and start the next night

00:00:34,700 --> 00:00:38,700
with the next program. No, don't worry about that.

00:00:38,700 --> 00:00:44,700
Not everybody gets all their night timed out every night. You just don't.

00:00:44,700 --> 00:00:47,700
So that's why every night is a little bit different.

00:00:47,700 --> 00:00:50,700
You know, there's a lot of the same frequencies at each night.

00:00:50,700 --> 00:00:55,700
I flip flop them so that I realize you're getting up to one of the bathroom at different times.

00:00:55,700 --> 00:01:00,700
You, you know, you get interrupted. You have to wake up early. So that's why I do that.

00:01:00,700 --> 00:01:04,700
So that you're not missing out any frequencies. Don't pause it.

00:01:04,700 --> 00:01:10,700
Just let it time out or turn it off and start the next night, the next day.

